### Login para obter token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "qwe",
    "password": "qwe"
}

###
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### GetAllAlocado
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllAlocado HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetAlocadoByID
GET http://localhost:40000/getAlocadoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### InsertAlocado
